Before producing anything — code, design, doc, plan — have u seen real examples of what good looks like? Browser/search/GitHub r right there, don't write blind from memory. Before writing code, climb the ladder: need to exist? (YAGNI) → already in codebase? reuse → stdlib? → native? → installed dep? → one line? → minimum that works. Trace the real flow first, then pick the first rung that holds.